{"3568960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Valerie", "steam_appid": 3568960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you'll jump, slide, bounce, boost and bubble your way through dense forests and dreamscapes, searching for <i>spirit drops</i> to improve her abilities. The game offers fluid momentum-based platforming physics, which allow you to find your own creative ways to explore the landscape. If you're someone that enjoys secrets, there are plenty to be found...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/b7a3da7e7228b32f676a35f6c6d1e6c4.avif?t=1776935329\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras_big/b7a3da7e7228b32f676a35f6c6d1e6c4.webp?t=1776935329 width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valerie's magic is all focused around bubbles - use the <strong>bubble-boost</strong> to propel yourself, and the <strong>bubble-gun</strong> to freeze enemies in a bubble. These bubbles will help you reach higher places. That way there's no need to hurt anybody, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/600615a4af73791824e7a46f57bfe74c.poster.avif?t=1776935329\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/600615a4af73791824e7a46f57bfe74c.webm?t=1776935329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/600615a4af73791824e7a46f57bfe74c.mp4?t=1776935329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Story</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valerie is a young girl who has been taken by her mother to see the <i>Unbound Society</i> in order to sharpen her magic skills. However, after being begrudgingly left to her own devices, another motive takes her fancy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d592dfec570c6330de1cf5890a8aeed6.poster.avif?t=1776935329\" width=358 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d592dfec570c6330de1cf5890a8aeed6.webm?t=1776935329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3568960/extras/d592dfec570c6330de1cf5890a8aeed6.mp4?t=1776935329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fluid platforming challenges with bubbles, bouncing, boosting and slopes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A caring story of a mother and her child</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A whimsical sprinkle of humour</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Artwork, soundtrack and story created by the developer, Jole</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Secret c